Start with the list of numbers 1, 3, 5, and 6.
Let target be 5.
Let count be the number of items in numbers.
Let found position be -1.
For every position from 0 to the last position of numbers.
If item position of numbers is target or item position of numbers is more than target, set found position to position, print found position, then stop.

If found position is -1, print count.
